# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# The package description for tools/package.py (NBTFoundry/manager): one argument
# per line. `make package` and the release workflow both use it; they add the
# version, sequence, key, output and executable. Bridge 1.7: the payload is a
# module or a guest built with the NBT toolchain, run by NBT Manager's
# nbt-runner (runner); the native form's lines are in native.args.
# Capabilities and limits: NBTFoundry/manager, docs/app-bridge.md.
--app
myapp
--compat
nbt_6.5_armv7
--bridge
1.7
--bridge-uses
show,controller,runner
--bridge-optional
status,live-settings
# Settings: key|Label|default|choices, at most 12.
--setting
debug_log|Debug log|off|off,on
# What the phone app shows before an install.
--property
Licence|MPL-2.0
--text
My App for NBT Manager.
--text=
--text
Source, licences and notices: https://github.com/NBTFoundry/template
